{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Access Control - Network Zones - Okta Network Zone Modified or Unblocked",
	"Description": "A network zone was modified, or an address range was removed from a blocklist zone. Adding the adversary's own egress range to a trusted zone, or pulling it out of a blocklist, turns a location restriction into a no-op.\n\nEvent types: zone.update, zone.remove_blacklist, security.zone.remove_blacklist\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/defense_evasion_okta_attempt_to_modify_okta_network_zone/",
